<title>USA: United Retail Group Q4 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>United Retail Group Q4 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHELLE PARK, N.J. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	 loss  $0.13	     loss $0.29</p>
<p> Net	 loss  1,529	     loss 3,558</p>
<p> Sales	     93,774		   102,574</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  12,190		   12,190</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 loss  $0.50		loss$0.38</p>
<p> Net	 loss  6,147		loss4,639</p>
<p> Sales	     363,074		  369,173</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  12,190		   12,190</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q4 1996 includes write-downs of $1.4 million and Q4 1995 includes write-downs of $1.9 million. Before the write-downs, United Retail's net loss for Q4 1996 was $100,000 or $0.01 per share, compared to a net loss of $1.6 million or $0.13 per share in the year-ago quarter.</p>
<p>Full company name is United Retail Group Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
